      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you need to overwrite your magic string here? `mkfs.ext4` erases and/or trims block zero anyway. Less code and less race between block zero zapped and mkfs complete.",
      "revId": "029ff79068646723da111dac48de3b6d703403ad",
